kdown\":\"Use a $450 planning allowance for two people: $300 for two nights, $120 for meals, and $30 for local transport. Intercity tickets and any tour fees are additional; confirm actual prices before booking. Keep skywatching optional.\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"}]},{\"prefillPrompt\":\"Use financial information from connected apps you can access and details I’ve shared to make a budget tracker for this month. Organize income and spending and track my savings goals, using my accounts’ currencies and keeping their totals separate. If no figures are available, help me start an editable budget. Update this Page and preserve my edits.\",\"id\":\"budget-tracker\",\"title\":\"Budget tracker\",\"setupQuestion\":\"What would you like help with—tracking spending, saving toward a goal, or both?\",\"previewMarkdown\":\"## Budget period\\nAdd the time period and currency.\\n\\n## Planned and actual spending\\n| Category | Planned | Actual | Remaining |\\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\\n| Housing | | | |\\n| Food | | | |\\n| Transport | | | |\\n\\n## Transactions\\nAdd income and expenses with dates and sources.\\n\\n## Review\\nNote missing figures and changes for next period.\",\"prompt\":\"Use relevant financial information from connected apps you can access to build my budget tracker. Organize income and spending, show how they compare, and help me track progress toward my goals. Use the currency shown in my accounts and start with this month unless I specify otherwise. Keep totals for different currencies separate. Use the details I’ve already shared, and ask for missing essentials only after checking the available information. If no financial information is available, start with an editable budget and ask what I’d like to add. Update this Page and preserve my edits.\"},{\"prefillPrompt\":\"Help me compare apartments by rent, fees, availability, and my preferences, with listing links and next steps. Use details I’ve shared and relevant conversations and connected apps you can ac