an |\\n| --- | --- |\\n| Capacity | 40 visitors |\\n| Planning budget | $300 total: $100 printing and $200 refreshments |\\n| Access | Step-free entrance, seating, large-print handouts |\\n| Main contact | Sam at the welcome desk |\",\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"layout\":\"normal\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"## 🕰️ Run of show\"},{\"markdown\":\"| Time | Activity | Lead |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n| 17:15 | Set up and volunteer briefing | Sam |\\n| 18:00 | Welcome and image gallery | Maya |\\n| 18:30 | A short tour of the lunar landscape | Priya |\\n| 19:00 | Indoor questions; outdoor viewing if conditions allow | Priya |\\n| 20:00 | Close and reset the room | Team |\",\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"layout\":\"normal\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"## ✅ Preparation\"},{\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Sam: confirm the room layout and step-free visitor route.\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Maya: print 50 handouts and the caption cards before the room check.\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Priya: confirm the observing setup and brief volunteers on the indoor alternative.\"},{\"kind\":\"markdown\",\"markdown\":\"## ☁️ If plans change\"},{\"markdown\":\"At 16:00, Sam confirms whether outdoor viewing will run. The indoor event goes ahead either way. Sam updates the welcome desk and guest message; if viewing is cancelled, Priya extends the indoor questions and image discussion.\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"markdown\":\"## 📝 Afterwards\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Gather short visitor comments.\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"},{\"markdown\":\"- [ ] Record useful changes for the next event.\",\"kind\":\"markdown\"}],\"title\":\"Event Plan\",\"prefillPrompt\":\"Help me plan my event, including the schedule, people involved, preparation, and follow-up. Use the details I’ve shared and relevant conversations and connected apps you can access to fill in this Page. Ask for missing essentials only after checking that context.